%!PS
% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% oracle: colour
% Scenario: a shading pattern fills text and a stroke. A radial shading
% pattern is set with setpattern, a string is shown, and a path is
% stroked: the page's text run and stroke carry the pattern as their
% colour, and the resources hold one shading pattern naming the radial
% shading with the instance's matrix.
/Sh << /ShadingType 3 /ColorSpace /DeviceRGB /Coords [150 400 0 150 400 120]
   /Function << /FunctionType 2 /Domain [0 1] /C0 [1 1 0] /C1 [0 0.5 0] /N 1 >>
   /Extend [false true] >> def
/P << /PatternType 2 /Shading Sh >> matrix makepattern def
/Helvetica-Bold findfont 72 scalefont setfont
P setpattern
60 380 moveto (Glow) show
12 setlinewidth
60 300 moveto 280 300 lineto stroke
showpage
